{"id":"678bca5e05fe3fce","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-prob4-exchangeable-sequence.md","title":"ZFC Prob4 Exchangeable Sequence","display":"df-zfc-prob4-exchangeable-sequence — ZFC Prob4 Exchangeable Sequence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-prob4-exchangeable-sequence","aliases":["58-df-zfc-prob4-exchangeable-sequence"],"display":"df-zfc-prob4-exchangeable-sequence — ZFC Prob4 Exchangeable Sequence","depends_on":["[[58-df-measure-space]]","[[58-df-measurable-function]]","[[58-df-measurable-space]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-bijective]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-prob4-exchangeable-sequence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-prob4-exchangeable-sequence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-prob4-exchangeable-sequence — ZFC Prob4 Exchangeable Sequence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"83a15c7e9b3817dc\" href=\"?note=83a15c7e9b3817dc\" title=\"58-df-measure-space\">58-df-measure-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"58-df-measurable-function\">58-df-measurable-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7f96c502a4a99a46\" href=\"?note=7f96c502a4a99a46\" title=\"58-df-measurable-space\">58-df-measurable-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d583890235faf0d5\" href=\"?note=d583890235faf0d5\" title=\"58-df-bijective\">58-df-bijective</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\">\\((\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\)</span> (probability space)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(E,\\mathcal E)\">\\((E,\\mathcal E)\\)</span> (measurable target space)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec X=(X_n)_{n\\in\\omega}\">\\(\\vec X=(X_n)_{n\\in\\omega}\\)</span> (sequence of random variables)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span> (finite-dimensional marginal length)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\\in V\">\\(\\pi\\in V\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bijective}(\\pi,n,n)\">\\(\\mathrm{Bijective}(\\pi,n,n)\\)</span> (permutation of coordinates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_n\\subseteq\\mathcal P(E^n)\">\\(\\mathcal C_n\\subseteq\\mathcal P(E^n)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathcal C_n\">\\(C\\in\\mathcal C_n\\)</span> (finite product sigma algebra and a measurable target).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\in\\Omega\">\\(u\\in\\Omega\\)</span> (sample point bound in the assertion)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S,\\mathrm{MeasurableSpace}_S,\\mathrm{Measurable}_S,\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{Bijective}\">\\(\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S,\\mathrm{MeasurableSpace}_S,\\mathrm{Measurable}_S,\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{Bijective}\\)</span> (source predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FiniteProductSigma}_S(\\mathcal C_n,E,\\mathcal E,n)\">\\(\\mathrm{FiniteProductSigma}_S(\\mathcal C_n,E,\\mathcal E,n)\\)</span> (finite product-sigma-algebra predicate defined here).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProb4ExchangeableSequence}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProb4ExchangeableSequence}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob4\\text{-}finite\\text{-}product\\text{-}sigma} \\vdash \\mathrm{FiniteProductSigma}_S(\\mathcal C_n,E,\\mathcal E,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\mathcal C_n=\\bigcap\\{\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathcal P(E^n):\\mathrm{MeasurableSpace}_S(E^n,\\mathcal D)\\land\\forall\\vec B\\in\\mathcal E^n\\;(\\prod_{i&lt;n}\\vec B(i)\\in\\mathcal D)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob4\\text{-}finite\\text{-}product\\text{-}sigma} \\vdash \\mathrm{FiniteProductSigma}_S(\\mathcal C_n,E,\\mathcal E,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\mathcal C_n=\\bigcap\\{\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathcal P(E^n):\\mathrm{MeasurableSpace}_S(E^n,\\mathcal D)\\land\\forall\\vec B\\in\\mathcal E^n\\;(\\prod_{i&lt;n}\\vec B(i)\\in\\mathcal D)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob4\\text{-}exchangeable\\text{-}sequence} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcProb4ExchangeableSequence}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E,\\vec X)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\\mathbb P(\\Omega)=1\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec X,\\omega,\\mathcal P(\\Omega\\times E))\\land\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec X(k),\\Omega,E)\\land\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(\\vec X(k);(\\Omega,\\mathcal F),(E,\\mathcal E))\\bigr)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists\\mathcal C_n\\subseteq\\mathcal P(E^n)\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{FiniteProductSigma}_S(\\mathcal C_n,E,\\mathcal E,n)\\land\\forall\\pi\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Bijective}(\\pi,n,n)\\to\\forall C\\in\\mathcal C_n\\;\\bigl(\\mathbb P(\\{u\\in\\Omega:\\langle\\vec X(0)(u),\\ldots,\\vec X(n-1)(u)\\rangle\\in C\\})=\\mathbb P(\\{u\\in\\Omega:\\langle\\vec X(\\pi(0))(u),\\ldots,\\vec X(\\pi(n-1))(u)\\rangle\\in C\\})\\bigr)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob4\\text{-}exchangeable\\text{-}sequence} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcProb4ExchangeableSequence}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E,\\vec X)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\\mathbb P(\\Omega)=1\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec X,\\omega,\\mathcal P(\\Omega\\times E))\\land\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec X(k),\\Omega,E)\\land\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(\\vec X(k);(\\Omega,\\mathcal F),(E,\\mathcal E))\\bigr)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists\\mathcal C_n\\subseteq\\mathcal P(E^n)\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{FiniteProductSigma}_S(\\mathcal C_n,E,\\mathcal E,n)\\land\\forall\\pi\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Bijective}(\\pi,n,n)\\to\\forall C\\in\\mathcal C_n\\;\\bigl(\\mathbb P(\\{u\\in\\Omega:\\langle\\vec X(0)(u),\\ldots,\\vec X(n-1)(u)\\rangle\\in C\\})=\\mathbb P(\\{u\\in\\Omega:\\langle\\vec X(\\pi(0))(u),\\ldots,\\vec X(\\pi(n-1))(u)\\rangle\\in C\\})\\bigr)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Exchangeability is equality of every finite-dimensional joint law under set-coded bijections of the finite index ordinal; the random-variable sequence is an explicit function graph.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-measure-space","status":"resolved","id":"83a15c7e9b3817dc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-measure-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-measurable-function","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · de